/*******************************************************
 * PLAN2PROTOTYPE
 * IoT SMART AUTOMATIC PLANT WATERING V1
 * (Hardcoded WiFi + Blynk Auth Token version)
 *
 * FEATURES IN THIS VERSION:
 *   - WiFi/Blynk connect in the background; no blocking
 *     wait screen.
 *   - Sensor-fault detection removed.
 *   - Pump status (V1) AND switch (V5) re-sent every cycle
 *     to keep the app dashboard in sync, whether the pump
 *     was started by AUTO logic or a MANUAL tap.
 *   - Logo screen (held longer), then Welcome screen with
 *     a static "SYSTEM LOADING" label + animated dots
 *     underneath it (label prints once, only the dots move).
 *   - Main screen shows: SOIL:xx%  (mode letter, centered)  W:OK/NO
 *   - Auto-watering will not start the pump until 30 seconds
 *     after the main screen (soil %) first appears -- avoids
 *     an immediate pump-on right at boot.
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   NodeMCU ESP-12E
 *   Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor
 *   LCD 1602 I2C
 *   Relay
 *   Water Pump
 *   Status LED
 *   Setup/Manual Button
 *
 * Blynk:
 *   V0 = Soil Moisture
 *   V1 = Pump Status
 *   V2 = Mode
 *   V3 = Moisture Threshold
 *   V4 = Watering Duration
 *   V5 = Pump Control
 *
 *******************************************************/

